# MCP Toolbox Server - Python UVX Package

This package provides the MCP Toolbox Server as a Python package installable via `uv` and executable via `uvx`. It bundles the pre-compiled Go binary for your platform.

This is part of the Crema project to enable Claude Code integration.

## Installation

Install using `uv`:

```bash
uv pip install toolbox-sdk-server

